    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if a professional can even help. how can someone help me find a self that isn't there anymore? if the \"me\" part of me is just evaporating, it feels like there's nothing left to save. it's almost like i'm just a hollow shell waiting for the rest to disappear. if there isn't a real person inside anymore, does it even matter if i stay?",
